OL,3,GNEWSAPolice numbers rise after funding
OL,4,Aboost
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincolnshire Police says a record
OL,7,Fnumber of officers will join the force
OL,8,Fthis year, with PCSO and neighbourhood
OL,9,Fteams also being strengthened.
OL,11,FThe force had paused recruitment and
OL,12,Fleft vacancies unfilled to manage
OL,13,Fbudget pressures, amid the possibility
OL,14,Fof up to 400 job cuts.
OL,16,FHowever, earlier this year the
OL,17,Fgovernment agreed an additional #12m in
OL,18,Ffunding over the next three years and
OL,19,Fthe force has since confirmed staff
OL,20,Fnumbers are rising again.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
