OL,3,GNEWSAPolice numbers rise after funding
OL,4,Aboost
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice and crime commissioner Marc
OL,7,FJones said the force had already
OL,8,Frecruited a record 127 warranted
OL,9,Fofficers, "through traditional
OL,10,Ftraining, transfers, and 20 direct
OL,11,Fentry detectives".
